        <activityName xml:lang="en">Road construction, asphalt surface layer, installation process</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Road construction, asphalt surface layer, installation process
Modern European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: ce8674d9-b9a7-4752-a257-7a8356825c11
This process represents the installation of one ton of asphalt surface course in road construction, including the laying and compaction activities.
Location: Europe
Technology: Generic process for different types of asphalt surface courses and varying shares of recycled asphalt (RAP).
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ce8674d9-b9a7-4752-a257-7a8356825c11.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
